      "en": "Then he departed from Elisha, and came to his master, who said to him, “What did Elisha say to you?” He answered, “He told me that you would surely recover.”",
      "ko": "저가 엘리사를 떠나가서 그 주인에게 나아가니 왕이 묻되 엘리사가 네게 무슨 말을 하더냐 대답하되 저가 내게 이르기를 왕이 정녕 나으시리라 하더이다",
      "source_text_hash": "674c58674232c305dc2e150e381162420217c2f7a7482194971a7a1b4e85e17d",
