      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 26
        }
      ],
      "en": "Ahaziah was twenty-two years old when he began to reign; and he reigned one year in Jerusalem. His mother’s name was Athaliah the daughter of Omri king of Israel.",
      "ko": "아하시야가 위에 나아갈 때에 나이 이십이세라 예루살렘에서 일년을 치리하니라 그 모친의 이름은 아달랴라 이스라엘 왕 오므리의 손녀더라",
      "source_text_hash": "6c703a3bd56ad1bda2e4fd17d6135d55ae822bf99a42b7a808a44cd77ee17cc7",
      "translation_text_hash": "b9e171fffb32c922779caa06845e735da118771fc548e98fcbfbd02b6e338899",
